      {
        "text": "The shared ExLlamaV3 version was 0.0.4. The commit, signed off by kingbri, announces v0.0.5, and the sole changed line sets __version__ to \"0.0.5\".",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_919d756383af4747a100cfc47dc9d57e",
          "call_fe815383647e4eef8b58ca30c2ffeaff"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "reasoning": [
      {
        "text": "One assignment supplies the package base version, the version stamped into newly created EXL3 quantization metadata, and the base version parsed by the release workflow. Keeping the assignment syntax unchanged lets all three consumers pick up the new value without separate edits.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_fe815383647e4eef8b58ca30c2ffeaff",
          "call_d4e2a681e431445aa3e1c98f13992e5c",
